, \"severity_ok\": true, \"reason\": \"I checked the finding against data/skills.json and it holds. Every lead and cross-cutting skill is a direct child of engine-architect, so one lead's subtree never contains another lead. Six workstreams contain more than one subtree:\\n- rendering: render-architect (15 skills) and gpu-platform-architect (11). ray-tracing-infrastructure sits under gpu-platform-architect and consumes C-RSCENE and C-INSTANCES.\\n- simulation: physics-architect and animation-architect.\\n- content: content-pi\n...\n</persisted-output>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"42e3e054-1494-4453-9102-5c8a85c5a48f","timestamp":"2026-09-30T07:43:08.793Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d728a45c-022a-41b3-8541-9ede728e0248","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
