{"parentUuid":"c9d1126e-b943-4bc9-94b9-dc1f13feba84","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"8c0f41b5-446a-49e2-8833-723d238c3f62","agentId":"a36348b9735cf680f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0159wK55cZer4okMz7vqYCkJ","type":"tool_result","content":"RND.GRAPH.external-work [\"RND.GRAPH.external-work\", \"External GPU work & transfer arbitration: streaming uploads, GPU decompression, scene deltas, AS builds and VT pages as registered producers with priority/deadline/byte budgets per tier; copy/async-queue placement; import of externally written resources, queue-ownership transfer & first-use acquire\", \"render-graph-scheduling\", \"E\", [\"async-io-storage\", \"gpu-memory-resources\", \"ray-tracing-infrastructure\", \"resource-streaming-architect\"]]\n{'id': 'C-RTAS', 'layer': 2, 'owner': 'ray-tracing-infrastructure', 'name': 'Acceleration structures & ray queries', 'summary': 'Acceleration-structure build/refit/compaction, instance and geometry inputs, ray-query API with hardware and software backends; independent of the render scene.', 'requires': ['C-RHI', 'C-GPUMEM'], 'conformance': True, 'gated': True, 'oracle_author': 'render-validation', 'oracle_reference': ['reference ray-query scenes with analytic hit results']}\nPass/resource declaration, queues, history resources, readback, dynamic GPU-generated work nodes; barrier output mapped or elided on implicit-sync backends.\nIO requests, priorities, deadlines, completions, decompression targets; GPU decompression is declared as external work items executed as render-graph nodes where no dedicated decompression queue exists.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3904a65e-69f0-45df-9a99-e00a69469c20","timestamp":"2026-09-30T07:44:24.428Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c9d1126e-b943-4bc9-94b9-dc1f13feba84","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"claude/eng